# Kitesail Corsair has flying only while it is attacking (CR 506.4, 604.1, 702.9b), so Bot2's Corsair, untapped and not attacking, cannot
# block Bot1's Mocking Sprite (flying) on turn 3: the Sprite deals 2 to Bot2. It can block a ground creature, though: Bot1's Runeclaw Bear
# is blocked by it, the Bear dying to the Corsair's 2 damage and the Corsair to the Bear's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mocking Sprite
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Runeclaw Bear
Island x22

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Kitesail Corsair
Island x22

